kingunix@garnet.berkeley.edu (Rob Broekhuis) answered:
> Presumably wiz had stolen it in an earlier incarnation.  So the amulet would
> be further down than where you tried to find it.  Or, if MrWiz did his trick,
> you may have to search in both locations where you killed him.
> Yep, trivial help, but I think you're in for quite a search.  Good luck!

	I did end up finding the Amulet several floors down.  Thanks Rob.

	Here's a hint for anyone else in this sorry situation:

	Beg steal borrow or wish for a blessed crystal ball (and some blessed
	scrolls of charging would also be handy if you have a lot of floors to
	search).  That way, you can just a)pply the crystal ball, and when it
	asks you what to look for, type " and it will happily show you any
	amulets on that level.  If you get the message "The image is unclear",
	this just means there are no amulets anywhere on that level.
	Saves a LOT of searching.

	Oh, and when you get to the Earth, Air and Fire levels, _cursed_
	scrolls of gold detection come in plenty handy too: they pinpoint that
	pesky magic portal.  Also saves a heap of searching.  (This hint isn't
	much use on the Water level though, since the *&$!^#@ portal moves.)


